{"repositoryId":1386187964,"availability":"available","full":"VedxntDev/Ratio-d","name":"Ratio-d","description":"Ratio'd is a scam risk analyzer for email and SMS that works as a Chrome extension, checking messages right inside Gmail, as a web tool at ratio-d.vercel.app where you can paste suspicious text.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-24T18:49:49Z","updated":"2026-10-12T09:00:15Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ratio-d.vercel.app/","topics":["cybersecurity"],"demo":"https://ratio-d.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:58.905Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:58.905Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:58.905Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:45:58.905Z","stars":1,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Privacy-First Phishing & Fraud Detection Engine · Developed by Vedant Singh Baghel, Vasu Arora & Utkarsh Upadhyaa","[]( []( [](./package.json) [](#-uiux-philosophy--design-system) [](./server/test-phishing.js) [](#5-reliability-performance--security)","Ratio'd is a privacy-first scam risk analyzer for email and smishing threats. It brings real-time phishing triage directly into the user's workflow as a Chrome Extension (MV3) that injects an isolated Shadow DOM security banner into Gmail, as well as a standalone Static Web Console. It redacts PII client-side in browser memory before network hops, scores messages using a calibrated 0–100 Risk Engine, detects Zero-Trust QR Code Phishing (Quishing), traces shortened URLs safely via Safe Peek, and delivers plain-English explanations with actionable recovery checklists."],"features":["🛡️ Air-Gapped Client PII Redaction: Phone numbers, personal emails, and 4–8 digit OTP codes are masked in local browser memory (js/redactor.js) before network transit.","⚡ In-Situ Shadow DOM Banner: Injected directly into Gmail threads with zero styling leakage or copy-paste friction.","🎯 Calibrated 70/30 Hybrid Scoring & VegaML Physics Engine: Combines a 70% deterministic rule engine with a 30% VegaML 64-D Hamiltonian dynamical model, dynamic thermodynamic temperature calibration ($\\tau$),…","📱 Zero-Trust Quishing Shield: Asynchronously decodes embedded QR images using jsQR and evaluates payloads against zero-trust risk floors.","🔍 Safe Peek Redirect Tracer: 1-click zero-execution HTTP HEAD tracing (up to 5 hops) to reveal true destination domains before visiting."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VedxntDev/Ratio-d/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1bafb9921c38be1a15b0093cfe257a428cb22bb2bf58df8a95b628811128cf24","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:59.071Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:59.071Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Privacy-First Phishing & Fraud Detection Engine · Developed by Vedant Singh Baghel, Vasu Arora & Utkarsh Upadhyaa","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VedxntDev/Ratio-d/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1bafb9921c38be1a15b0093cfe257a428cb22bb2bf58df8a95b628811128cf24","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VedxntDev/Ratio-d/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:59.072Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T09:00:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/VedxntDev/Ratio-d/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T11:45:59.073Z","hash":"1bafb9921c38be1a15b0093cfe257a428cb22bb2bf58df8a95b628811128cf24","originalBytes":43308,"storedBytes":43308,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["engine","banner","extension","risk","vegaml","api","ratio","gmail","rule","server","score","web","browser","security","threat","zero-trust","dom","model","pii","rules","safe","chrome","gateway","phishing","tracer","class","classdef","client","color","core","email","fill","json","mail","post","shadow","stroke","stroke-width","badge","code","console","high","peek","quishing","raw","stage","test","verdict","air-gapped","analysis","combiner","determi